WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:03.750
The semi-finals match against Nankatsu is almost here.

00:03.750 --> 00:06.980
I can say that today, we'll face our biggest hurdle in this tournament.

00:06.980 --> 00:11.540
Don't think about tomorrow. Just give everything you've got today, and face them head on!

00:11.540 --> 00:12.240
Yes, sir!

00:12.240 --> 00:13.470
Good.

00:13.470 --> 00:14.540
Coach!

00:14.540 --> 00:16.210
What is it, Manager?

00:16.210 --> 00:19.410
You see, Yoshiko made headbands for everyone.

00:19.410 --> 00:20.250
Oh...

00:20.250 --> 00:24.160
Well, no other team had them, so...

00:25.280 --> 00:26.830
Come on, let me see them.

00:29.820 --> 00:33.300
Wow... Making this many must have been hard.

00:35.300 --> 00:39.190
By the way, you'll be in the US in the second semester, right Fujisawa?

00:39.190 --> 00:43.940
We swore to become the national champions to give you a great memory as a parting gift.

00:45.170 --> 00:47.940
All right! We'll put these on in today's match!

00:47.940 --> 00:49.330
Yeah! Agreed!

00:49.330 --> 00:50.130
These are nice!

00:50.130 --> 00:51.690
These look cooler than I thought.

00:51.690 --> 00:53.320
Gotta stand out sometimes, right?

00:53.320 --> 00:54.650
Yeah...

00:54.650 --> 00:55.930
Here, Oda.

00:55.930 --> 00:56.530
Yes.

00:56.530 --> 01:00.410
Yoshiko embroidered your numbers on each of them.

01:00.410 --> 01:02.000
Wow, you're right!

01:02.000 --> 01:04.090
Here you go, Matsuyama.

01:04.090 --> 01:05.810
Okay, thank you!

01:11.870 --> 01:12.590
<i>All right!</i>

01:13.070 --> 01:15.140
<i>We're finally there, Nankatsu.</i>

01:15.140 --> 01:17.680
<i>Furano will definitely win!</i>

01:17.680 --> 01:20.640
NANKATSU MIDDLE SCHOOL
SHIZUOKA PREFECTURE

01:18.440 --> 01:20.640
Will you really be all right, Tsubasa?

01:20.640 --> 01:24.900
Yeah. If my ankle's properly taped, I'll more or less be able to play as usual.

01:24.900 --> 01:26.810
My shoulder's feeling much better, too.

01:27.490 --> 01:29.160
Anyway, just 2 more matches to go.

01:29.160 --> 01:31.650
Even if my body's torn to pieces, I'll do this.

01:31.650 --> 01:35.350
If you're this fired up, Tsubasa, you leave us no choice but to go full speed ahead!

01:35.350 --> 01:36.070
Yeah!

01:36.520 --> 01:37.500
<i>All right!</i>

01:37.500 --> 01:39.070
<i>Let's do this, Matsuyama.</i>

01:46.250 --> 01:48.960
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

01:46.250 --> 01:48.960
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

01:49.880 --> 01:52.550
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

01:49.880 --> 01:52.550
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

01:53.460 --> 01:56.170
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

01:53.460 --> 01:56.170
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

02:03.060 --> 02:05.890
<i>moeru you ni hitori demo</i>

02:03.060 --> 02:05.890
<i>I keep running, lying to myself</i>

02:05.890 --> 02:12.150
<i>ikiteyukeru to usobuite hashiritsudzukete</i>

02:05.890 --> 02:12.150
<i>that I can live alone, though the loneliness makes me burn</i>

02:12.150 --> 02:18.030
<i>unubore no morosa wo kimi wa shitteta no ni</i>

02:12.150 --> 02:18.030
<i>You knew how fragile my self-conceit makes me</i>

02:18.030 --> 02:24.620
<i>kokoro made uchinomaresareta kono yoru ni</i>

02:18.030 --> 02:24.620
<i>In this night that even shattered my heart</i>

02:24.620 --> 02:28.620
<i>kimi no koe sagasu</i>

02:24.620 --> 02:28.620
<i>I hate how weak I am</i>

02:28.620 --> 02:33.130
<i>kono yowasa ga nikui yo</i>

02:28.620 --> 02:33.130
<i>yearning for your voice</i>

02:33.130 --> 02:38.720
<i>ima sugu torimodoshi ni ikanakya</i>

02:33.130 --> 02:38.720
<i>"I've got to get you back right now!"</i>

02:38.720 --> 02:40.260
<i>baka darou?</i>

02:38.720 --> 02:40.260
<i>I'm stupid, right?</i>

02:40.260 --> 02:41.470
<i>ai</i>

02:40.260 --> 02:41.470
<i>Love!</i>

02:41.470 --> 02:44.970
<i>kizudarake no ai wo shinjite</i>

02:41.470 --> 02:44.970
<i>Believing in my scarred love</i>

02:44.970 --> 02:54.860
<i>nagareochita namida sae mo tsuyosa e to kaete</i>

02:44.970 --> 02:54.860
<i>I will turn these shedded tears into strength</i>

02:54.860 --> 02:55.690
<i>ai</i>

02:54.860 --> 02:55.690
<i>Love!</i>

02:55.690 --> 02:59.490
<i>kizudarake no ai da to shite mo</i>

02:55.690 --> 02:59.490
<i>Even though it is a scarred love</i>

02:59.490 --> 03:03.490
<i>bokura no sekai wo tomoshiteru</i>

02:59.490 --> 03:03.490
<i>it lightens up our world</i>

03:03.490 --> 03:09.750
<i>kono ai mo ichido taritomo</i>

03:03.490 --> 03:09.750
<i>I will not let go of this love</i>

03:09.750 --> 03:12.580
<i>hanasanai</i>

03:09.750 --> 03:12.580
<i>for a single moment!</i>

03:14.210 --> 03:19.090
<b><b>EPISODE 44:
#10 VS. #10</b></b>

03:14.670 --> 03:17.080
<i>The game will begin shortly.</i>

03:17.080 --> 03:20.470
<i>The second semi-finals match of the National Middle School Football Tournament</i>

03:20.470 --> 03:26.470
<i>will be between Hokkaido's representatives, Furano MS, and Shizuoka's representatives, Nankatsu MS.</i>

03:26.470 --> 03:31.980
<i>In the end, which team will advance to meet Toho in tomorrow's grand final?</i>

03:33.180 --> 03:37.320
<i>Amidst the loud cheers, both teams have shown up on the field.</i>

03:37.320 --> 03:41.530
<i>What's this? All of Furano's members are wearing headbands as they step out onto the pitch.</i>

03:41.530 --> 03:45.780
<i>On the other side, Nankatsu are wearing their away team uniforms.</i>

03:45.780 --> 03:48.810
<i>Furano is led by their captain, Hikaru Matsuyama.</i>

03:48.810 --> 03:50.160
<i>He's the one wearing #10.</i>

03:50.160 --> 03:54.920
<i>Nankatsu's leader and captain, Tsubasa Ozora, is also wearing #10.</i>

03:55.460 --> 03:59.510
<i>For this game, we have two midfielder captains wearing the #10.</i>

03:59.510 --> 04:02.180
<i>Which one of them will dominate the midfield first?</i>

04:02.180 --> 04:06.050
<i>Even if you're injured, I won't hold back, Tsubasa!</i>

04:06.050 --> 04:07.490
<i>Two more to go...</i>

04:07.490 --> 04:08.900
<i>I will definitely win!</i>

04:08.900 --> 04:11.560
<i>I can't afford to lose to anyone in Japan!</i>

04:11.560 --> 04:15.350
<i>It looks like Nankatsu will start with the ball after the coin toss.</i>

04:15.970 --> 04:21.280
Tsubasa, Furano's football is all about taking Nankatsu down, and we'll fulfill that goal today.

04:21.280 --> 04:23.780
Matsuyama, I won't lose!

04:26.160 --> 04:28.910
<i>Please win, Matsuyama...</i>

04:28.910 --> 04:31.910
<i>Tsubasa, I hope your injuries don't get worse...</i>

04:31.910 --> 04:35.170
<i>Fight! Fight! Furano!</i>

04:35.170 --> 04:38.590
<i>Good luck! Good luck! Nankatsu!</i>

04:40.460 --> 04:44.630
<i>With the referee's whistle, the game finally begins!</i>

04:45.210 --> 04:45.930
Here!

04:46.900 --> 04:49.260
<i>The ball is passed to the playmaker, Tsubasa.</i>

04:50.450 --> 04:51.060
All right!

04:51.970 --> 04:58.590
<i>Tsubasa, if you send a back pass again, we'll all rush towards Nankatsu's goal at once.</i>

04:58.590 --> 05:01.610
<i>We'll show you Furano's Avalanche Attack!</i>

05:01.610 --> 05:03.860
Here I go, Tsubasa!

05:04.360 --> 05:07.530
<i>Matsuyama ferociously attacks Tsubasa!</i>

05:08.990 --> 05:10.260
<i>As I expected, Tsubasa.</i>

05:10.260 --> 05:12.220
<i>You knew you couldn't send a pass here.</i>

05:12.220 --> 05:15.210
<i>But the thing about this tackle... is that the first one is a decoy!</i>

05:15.210 --> 05:16.870
Here's the real deal!

05:17.470 --> 05:20.130
<i>Matsuyama quickly tackles him again!</i>

05:20.130 --> 05:21.630
You did it! You've got this!

05:21.630 --> 05:22.940
Our captain invented that!

05:22.940 --> 05:24.130
It's his Feinting Tackle!

05:25.040 --> 05:26.130
All right, let's go!

05:26.130 --> 05:27.130
Yeah!

05:27.130 --> 05:29.330
Damn it! Well played, Matsuyama.

05:29.330 --> 05:30.890
But I can't lose!

05:30.890 --> 05:35.020
<i>Tsubasa gets right back on his feet and chases after the dribbling Matsuyama.</i>

05:35.020 --> 05:36.190
Captain, watch out!

05:36.190 --> 05:36.850
What?!

05:38.760 --> 05:42.690
<i>Thanks to his comrade's warning, Matsuyama dumps the ball away in time!</i>

05:43.690 --> 05:44.940
Tsubasa...

05:46.740 --> 05:47.520
Take this!

05:47.520 --> 05:48.240
What?!

05:48.240 --> 05:48.930
Nice!

05:48.930 --> 05:49.950
Ishizaki!

05:49.950 --> 05:52.200
I won't lose to Tsubasa!

05:53.650 --> 05:58.560
<i>Tsubasa, you really do become a wild beast once you set foot on the pitch.</i>

05:58.560 --> 06:03.340
<i>If I start being considerate of your injuries in this match, we'll wind up being bitten, instead.</i>

06:03.340 --> 06:05.700
<i>Then, I will ignore your injuries in this match!</i>

06:05.700 --> 06:06.380
Here!

06:06.380 --> 06:07.630
Nice pass, Tsubasa!

06:07.630 --> 06:09.590
All right! Go for it, Kisugi!

06:11.470 --> 06:13.970
<i>Kisugi's shot deflects off the defender's leg!</i>

06:13.970 --> 06:16.430
<i>And the ball ends up right in front of Tsubasa.</i>

06:16.430 --> 06:17.440
<i>Good!</i>

06:18.230 --> 06:21.190
<i>Will we see Tsubasa's Drive Shot this soon?</i>

06:21.190 --> 06:22.730
<i>Like I'd let you!</i>

06:23.650 --> 06:25.650
<i>Matsuyama cuts through and blocks it!</i>

06:25.650 --> 06:26.570
Matsuyama!

06:26.570 --> 06:29.820
I can't have you firing off Drive Shots, no matter what!

06:31.310 --> 06:33.530
<i>Matsuyama goes on the offensive himself.</i>

06:33.530 --> 06:35.830
<i>And Tsubasa's right after him again!</i>

06:38.790 --> 06:44.750
<i>This has truly become an intense showdown between these two midfielders, these two #10s!</i>

06:44.750 --> 06:46.070
<i>Tsubasa...</i>

06:46.070 --> 06:47.130
<i>Matsuyama...</i>

06:52.830 --> 06:54.360
Go, Matsuyama!

06:54.360 --> 06:56.040
Stop him, Tsubasa!

06:59.140 --> 07:01.520
<i>They clash their kicking legs!</i>

07:01.520 --> 07:03.680
<i>The ball goes in the air!</i>

07:03.680 --> 07:04.660
<i>Matsuyama...</i>

07:04.660 --> 07:05.780
<i>Tsubasa!</i>

07:06.500 --> 07:08.860
<i>I won't let you rule the midfield!</i>

07:06.610 --> 07:08.860
I WON'T LET YOU RULE THE MIDFIELD.

07:10.310 --> 07:11.240
Go!

07:13.110 --> 07:14.740
<i>Two tall players clash!</i>

07:16.200 --> 07:18.200
<i>Who will get the loose ball?</i>

07:19.460 --> 07:19.910
All right!

07:19.910 --> 07:21.910
Go for it, Izawa!

07:21.910 --> 07:24.440
<i>Football is all about teamplay.</i>

07:24.440 --> 07:26.480
<i>If we consider Tsubasa and Matsuyama as equals,</i>

07:26.480 --> 07:29.260
<i>since Nankatsu has another playmaker in Izawa,</i>

07:29.260 --> 07:31.340
<i>they might just hold the advantage here.</i>

07:31.340 --> 07:32.560
Fall back, guys!

07:32.560 --> 07:33.590
We have to defend!

07:33.590 --> 07:34.930
This is for you, Kisugi!

07:34.930 --> 07:36.060
Take this!

07:36.060 --> 07:38.100
<i>A sliding shot from Kisugi!</i>

07:38.100 --> 07:38.970
Damn it!

07:39.590 --> 07:41.480
<i>But Furano block it!</i>

07:41.480 --> 07:43.230
<i>They completely block off their goal!</i>

07:43.230 --> 07:44.240
Clear it!

07:44.980 --> 07:47.100
<i>Furano are out of this predicament!</i>

07:47.910 --> 07:48.770
Crap!

07:49.530 --> 07:53.990
<i>Before Matsuyama has a chance to stop him, Tsubasa sends a pass towards Furano's goal.</i>

07:53.990 --> 07:56.280
Hold on, guys! We will get out of this!

07:57.620 --> 08:02.790
<i>Izawa takes the pass and fires off a jumping header!</i>

08:04.130 --> 08:05.240
<i>It's also blocked!</i>

08:05.240 --> 08:08.130
<i>The goalkeeper, Kato, barely manages to punch it away!</i>

08:08.130 --> 08:09.760
Nice one, Kato!

08:10.230 --> 08:11.050
Captain!

08:12.630 --> 08:14.310
You've defended our goal well!

08:14.310 --> 08:15.280
Everyone get up front!

08:15.280 --> 08:17.050
We're using Furano's Avalanche Attack!

08:17.050 --> 08:17.970
Yeah!

08:17.970 --> 08:19.180
What?!

08:19.180 --> 08:20.770
Did he just say "Avalanche Attack"?

08:20.770 --> 08:24.620
<i>Furano break for a fast counterattack, despite their disadvantageous position!</i>

08:24.620 --> 08:28.290
<i>All of their players are heading towards Nankatsu's goal!</i>

08:28.290 --> 08:29.740
<i>All right! Let's do it, guys!</i>

08:29.740 --> 08:32.000
<i>I will send the ball to you.</i>

08:32.000 --> 08:34.220
<i>What a bold tactic!</i>

08:34.220 --> 08:39.030
<i>Do they trust in Matsuyama's ball control skills that much?</i>

08:39.590 --> 08:41.890
<i>He passes Kisugi and Taki in the blink of an eye!</i>

08:41.890 --> 08:43.120
<i>That's Matsuyama for you!</i>

08:43.120 --> 08:45.980
<i>He's said to be #1 in ball control skills in the tournament!</i>

08:45.980 --> 08:47.540
<i>Oh, Tsubasa is almost there too!</i>

08:47.540 --> 08:48.540
So, before that...

08:49.710 --> 08:52.370
<i>Matsuyama fires off a long pass!</i>

08:52.370 --> 08:53.220
Let's go!

08:53.220 --> 08:54.090
Yeah!

08:54.090 --> 08:56.640
No matter how many of they come, there is only one ball!

08:56.640 --> 08:57.390
Just kick it away!

08:58.680 --> 09:00.870
If they kick it before us, we'll follow up!

09:00.870 --> 09:02.400
Damn, clear it!

09:02.400 --> 09:03.880
Cover it!

09:04.560 --> 09:05.520
What?!

09:05.520 --> 09:06.760
It's useless!

09:06.760 --> 09:09.860
Even when we clear it, they keep coming one after the other!

09:09.860 --> 09:12.040
If you steal the ball from one of us...

09:12.040 --> 09:13.280
...every single one of us...

09:13.280 --> 09:15.250
...will cover for each other!

09:15.250 --> 09:15.910
This is...

09:15.910 --> 09:16.990
...Furano's...

09:16.990 --> 09:19.160
...Avalanche Attack!

09:19.160 --> 09:20.610
<i>It's Furano's Avalanche Attack!</i>

09:20.610 --> 09:23.290
<i>Will it break Nankatsu's defense down in one go?</i>

09:23.290 --> 09:24.130
Take this!

09:24.130 --> 09:26.170
<i>They finally send the ball over the goal!</i>

09:27.040 --> 09:29.370
<i>The goalkeeper Morisaki punches it away!</i>

09:29.370 --> 09:31.670
<i>He narrowly escapes this crisis!</i>

09:31.670 --> 09:34.930
<i>But both Tsubasa and Matsuyama are running towards the loose ball!</i>

09:34.930 --> 09:36.470
<i>Which one is faster?</i>

09:36.470 --> 09:37.760
Captain, leave it to us!

09:38.300 --> 09:39.590
Okay!

09:39.590 --> 09:41.930
<i>Matsuyama is heading towards the goal!</i>

09:41.930 --> 09:42.930
Damn it!

09:45.150 --> 09:45.940
Crap!

09:46.980 --> 09:49.270
All right, I've got this!

09:51.860 --> 09:53.690
<i>The Big 2 of middle school football...</i>

09:54.200 --> 09:56.270
<i>Nankatsu and Toho.</i>

09:56.270 --> 09:59.470
<i>Compared to them, what Furano clearly lacks is scoring ability.</i>

09:59.470 --> 10:07.510
<i>To remedy it, if I want to score goals as a midfielder, I'll need to be able to fire long shots, all while setting up the game.</i>

10:07.510 --> 10:10.500
<i>I'm not naturally gifted, like Tsubasa and Hyuga.</i>

10:11.140 --> 10:12.800
<i>That's why I'll keep practicing!</i>

10:12.800 --> 10:16.880
<i>The untalented have no other choice but to work harder than everyone else!</i>

10:25.070 --> 10:28.640
<i>Matsuyama puts everything he has into this long shot!</i>

10:28.640 --> 10:29.770
Matsuyama!

10:29.770 --> 10:31.440
<i>He used this against Minamiuwa!</i>

10:31.440 --> 10:37.440
<i>Crawling along the earth and leaving a trail of dust in its wake, this is Matsuyama's thrilling long shot!</i>

10:41.010 --> 10:42.270
<i>It's in!</i>

10:42.270 --> 10:44.910
<i>Goalkeeper Morisaki was too slow to react!</i>

10:44.910 --> 10:46.600
<i>Furano gets ahead first!</i>

10:46.600 --> 10:47.250
All right!

10:47.250 --> 10:49.330
I scored one, everyone!

10:57.010 --> 10:59.020
You did it, captain!

10:59.020 --> 11:01.010
<i>Furano finally takes the lead!</i>

11:01.010 --> 11:06.470
<i>It was a splendid long shot, created through training his legs on the rough ground of the snowy land!</i>

11:06.470 --> 11:11.080
<i>Starting with Furano's Avalanche Attack and ending with captain Matsuyama's "Northern Country Shot",</i>

11:11.080 --> 11:13.480
<i>they have finally won themselves the lead!</i>

11:13.480 --> 11:15.670
They did it, Yoshiko!

11:15.670 --> 11:16.440
Yeah.

11:16.440 --> 11:17.780
Nice!

11:17.780 --> 11:18.780
<i>They got me.</i>

11:18.780 --> 11:23.410
<i>From the looks of that shot... You must have trained very hard, Matsuyama.</i>

11:23.410 --> 11:24.470
Damn it!

11:24.470 --> 11:26.810
We were the ones piling on the pressure, and yet...

11:26.810 --> 11:27.770
Damn it all.

11:27.770 --> 11:28.910
Guys.

11:28.910 --> 11:30.470
Let's refresh our mood.

11:30.470 --> 11:32.470
If we lose today, there is no tomorrow.

11:32.470 --> 11:34.920
Let's give it our best to defeat Furano today.

11:35.510 --> 11:39.800
We will win that unprecedented V3 with our own strength!

11:39.800 --> 11:41.130
Yeah!

11:42.370 --> 11:44.470
<i>Even though they conceded the first goal,</i>

11:44.470 --> 11:47.060
<i>Nankatsu's players shrug it off and move to attack!</i>

11:47.060 --> 11:49.260
<i>They're able to quickly recover their morale.</i>

11:49.260 --> 11:51.520
<i>That's the scary part of Nankatsu.</i>

11:51.520 --> 11:53.230
Keep yourself focused!

11:53.230 --> 11:53.980
Sure!

11:53.980 --> 11:58.020
<i>Captain Tsubasa dribbles forward with the ball on his own!</i>

11:58.020 --> 12:00.660
All right, leave Tsubasa to me!

12:02.110 --> 12:03.140
<i>Matsuyama!</i>

12:03.140 --> 12:04.200
<i>Tsubasa!</i>

12:04.200 --> 12:05.620
Take it!

12:05.620 --> 12:09.060
<i>He sends the ball to Taki before Matsuyama can reach him.</i>

12:09.060 --> 12:09.700
That's it.

12:09.700 --> 12:10.830
Go for it, guys!

12:10.830 --> 12:12.530
It Nankatsu's famous offense!

12:12.530 --> 12:14.670
It's just one goal! Quickly pay them back!

12:16.290 --> 12:17.770
<i>Furano did their homework.</i>

12:17.770 --> 12:19.000
<i>Kondo is here to mark.</i>

12:19.000 --> 12:20.380
One guy is no problem...!

12:21.720 --> 12:23.050
<i>Kondo stops him!</i>

12:23.050 --> 12:24.340
Nice one, Kondo!

12:25.300 --> 12:26.050
Wha–

12:26.050 --> 12:29.850
<i>Now here's Ishizaki with a brave overlap.</i>

12:29.850 --> 12:31.520
Watch me, guys!

12:31.520 --> 12:34.020
Here's what you've been waiting from Ryo Ishizaki!

12:34.020 --> 12:35.440
Nice overlap, Ishizaki!

12:35.440 --> 12:36.900
Send it before the goal.

12:37.730 --> 12:38.730
Here you go!

12:38.730 --> 12:42.280
<i>Izawa and Nagano who are known for their headers are near Furano's goal.</i>

12:42.280 --> 12:44.650
<i>Tsubasa is also running in behind them.</i>

12:45.900 --> 12:46.780
Take it!

12:46.780 --> 12:48.450
Great!

12:48.450 --> 12:49.950
<i>Tsubasa takes a diving header!</i>

12:50.450 --> 12:50.910
Oh!

12:51.430 --> 12:52.520
<i>It won't go!</i>

12:52.520 --> 12:54.540
<i>Matsuyama blocks the shot!</i>

12:54.540 --> 12:57.040
Fools, don't get ahead of yourselves!

12:57.040 --> 12:59.880
The ball is still in the game!

12:59.880 --> 13:02.960
<i>Ishizaki shoots the deflected ball from a hard angle!</i>

13:02.960 --> 13:03.840
Oh, crap!

13:04.470 --> 13:05.900
<i>It was so close!</i>

13:05.900 --> 13:07.430
<i>The ball falls out of bounds.</i>

13:07.430 --> 13:09.550
Damn, it was such a good chance, too...

13:10.620 --> 13:13.510
<i>Furano resumes the match with a goal kick.</i>

13:13.510 --> 13:14.310
Here!

13:14.310 --> 13:16.710
<i>He sends the ball to his captain, Matsuyama.</i>

13:16.710 --> 13:17.190
<i>Good.</i>

13:17.770 --> 13:20.670
<i>Tsubasa, I won't lose to you when it comes to controlling the ball.</i>

13:20.670 --> 13:22.900
<i>This time, I will break past you!</i>

13:22.900 --> 13:26.910
<i>Nankatsu send their Captain Tsubasa to mark Matsuyama.</i>

13:26.910 --> 13:31.490
<i>I will take back the goal we conceded because of my bad decision.</i>

13:34.940 --> 13:38.120
<i>Will Tsubasa steal the ball?</i>

13:38.120 --> 13:40.460
<i>Matsuyama is not giving up the ball though.</i>

13:43.960 --> 13:45.590
Captain, pass it to us!

13:45.590 --> 13:48.430
Please guys, count on me about this one.

13:48.430 --> 13:51.720
If I can get past Tsubasa here, the rest of the match will flow in our favor!

13:53.520 --> 13:57.440
<i>No other players involve themselves in this battle.</i>

13:57.440 --> 13:59.770
<i>Did they leave this to these two?</i>

13:59.770 --> 14:01.020
<i>That's Matsuyama for you.</i>

14:01.020 --> 14:02.480
<i>What awesome possession skill.</i>

14:02.480 --> 14:04.590
<i>He's giving me no chance to steal the ball.</i>

14:04.590 --> 14:06.460
<i>Damn, that's Tsubasa for you.</i>

14:06.460 --> 14:08.740
<i>He won't let me get past him so easily.</i>

14:13.910 --> 14:15.540
<i>At this rate, this will never end...</i>

14:15.540 --> 14:16.710
<i>It's time to sink or swim!</i>

14:19.080 --> 14:22.070
<i>Tsubasa has lost his balance!</i>

14:22.070 --> 14:23.550
<i>Great, here is my chance!</i>

14:24.170 --> 14:26.550
<i>Matsuyama won't let this chance go by.</i>

14:28.300 --> 14:29.290
What?!

14:29.290 --> 14:30.770
<i>He stopped him with his leg!</i>

14:30.770 --> 14:32.940
<i>It's a trick tackle from Tsubasa!</i>

14:32.940 --> 14:36.640
That's a high level feint he made his own after entering middle school.

14:36.640 --> 14:38.770
<i>He heads towards Furano's goal, full throttle!</i>

14:38.770 --> 14:40.190
Get back, guys!

14:40.190 --> 14:41.220
Damn!

14:41.220 --> 14:45.110
<i>Matsuyama feverishly pursues
Tsubasa after having the ball stolen.</i>

14:45.110 --> 14:48.610
<i>Tsubasa is getting ready for his Drive Shot!</i>

14:48.610 --> 14:51.740
I won't let you shoot that!

14:51.740 --> 14:52.750
What?!

14:52.750 --> 14:55.870
<i>Matsuyama's sliding block stops it once again!</i>

14:55.870 --> 14:58.200
<i>He won't let Tsubasa score.</i>

14:58.760 --> 15:00.960
<i>Tsubasa's Drive Shot...</i>

15:00.960 --> 15:03.380
<i>The fact that it takes time to get the shot ready,</i>

15:03.380 --> 15:05.880
<i>leaving him exposed, has been revealed.</i>

15:05.880 --> 15:08.290
<i>I'd expect no less from Matsuyama.</i>

15:08.290 --> 15:11.590
<i>But Matsuyama is not in any position to jump, yet!</i>

15:11.590 --> 15:12.890
Here I go!

15:13.840 --> 15:14.680
What?!

15:14.680 --> 15:20.810
<i>Here it is! Tsubasa's favorite move! After a long time, his Overhead Kick flies once again!</i>

15:26.480 --> 15:27.590
<i>It's in!</i>

15:27.590 --> 15:29.870
<i>The ball pierces the right corner of the goal!</i>

15:29.870 --> 15:32.950
<i>Tsubasa's Overhead Kick is exquisite, indeed!</i>

15:32.950 --> 15:34.450
You did it, Tsubasa!

15:34.450 --> 15:38.300
<i>Nankatsu have tied the game in the 28th minute of the first half!</i>

15:38.300 --> 15:39.330
Whoa...!

15:39.330 --> 15:40.120
This is bad!

15:40.120 --> 15:42.120
He'll hurt his shoulder again!

15:44.330 --> 15:45.340
Matsuyama!

15:45.340 --> 15:46.340
Tsubasa!

15:46.340 --> 15:46.840
Tsubasa!

15:46.840 --> 15:47.330
Captain!

15:47.330 --> 15:48.500
Tsubasa!

15:49.580 --> 15:50.840
Matsuyama!

15:51.950 --> 15:53.900
Damn, you got me bad.

15:53.900 --> 15:55.350
But, it's still just a tie!

15:55.350 --> 15:58.100
I will never give up!

15:58.100 --> 15:59.350
Matsuyama...

15:59.350 --> 16:05.300
<i>Matsuyama firmly caught Tsubasa as he was falling, saving him from further hurting his shoulder.</i>

16:05.300 --> 16:09.650
<i>A brilliant friendship between two players who are giving their best in a fair match.</i>

16:10.590 --> 16:12.360
Thanks, Matsuyama.

16:12.360 --> 16:14.120
It was nothing.

16:14.120 --> 16:17.300
I just want to beat you while you're in peak condition.

16:18.160 --> 16:20.740
<i>The first half ends here!</i>

16:20.740 --> 16:22.660
<i>The score is 1-1.</i>

16:22.660 --> 16:25.670
<i>Moreover, Tsubasa's injury that everyone was worried about</i>

16:25.670 --> 16:28.600
<i>has not visibly affected his play, which is a relief!</i>

16:29.610 --> 16:34.790
<i>An injury isn't something you can just get over in a couple of days.</i>

16:34.790 --> 16:38.710
<i>He may not be showing it,
but he's run a lot during this match.</i>

16:38.710 --> 16:42.060
<i>His left foot must be bearing quite the burden.</i>

16:42.060 --> 16:44.810
NANKATSU MIDDLE SCHOOL
SHIZUOKA PREFECTURE

16:43.010 --> 16:44.810
You did well guys.

16:44.810 --> 16:46.830
Tsubasa, can you continue?

16:46.830 --> 16:48.230
Yes! All good, sir.

16:52.360 --> 16:53.610
FURANO MIDDLE SCHOOL
HOKKAIDO

16:53.020 --> 16:56.390
All right, keep doing your thing and hang on this second half.

16:56.390 --> 16:58.090
Don't let this measly heat get to you!

16:58.090 --> 16:59.160
Yes, sir!

16:59.160 --> 17:02.980
<i>If we unite our strength, I am sure we can win this.</i>

17:02.980 --> 17:06.120
<i>When the time comes, I'll score again!</i>

17:09.090 --> 17:11.480
<i>I need to answer their trust in me.</i>

17:11.480 --> 17:16.130
<i>I will settle this with the Drive Shot I completed yesterday.</i>

17:16.840 --> 17:18.130
Tsubasa...

17:18.130 --> 17:19.740
<i>Don't tell me, you're...</i>

17:21.090 --> 17:24.350
Yoshiko! They've caught up with us.

17:24.350 --> 17:25.540
Yeah.

17:25.540 --> 17:28.350
Don't go "yeah" on me, at this rate, you...

17:29.390 --> 17:30.700
<i>Matsuyama.</i>

17:32.800 --> 17:34.650
<i>The second half is about to start.</i>

17:34.650 --> 17:37.490
<i>The clash begins once again and 30 minutes remain!</i>

17:41.200 --> 17:43.000
All right, let's go, everyone!

17:43.000 --> 17:44.200
Yeah!

17:44.200 --> 17:49.250
<i>These two forwards, Kisugi and Oda, fiercely clash with each other, right off the bat!</i>

17:50.750 --> 17:52.980
<i>Nankatsu takes the ball!</i>

17:52.980 --> 17:56.090
<i>Tsubasa's clearly been playing while hiding his injuries.</i>

17:56.090 --> 17:57.300
Izawa!

17:57.300 --> 18:00.260
<i>The pass makes it to the shadow playmaker, Izawa.</i>

18:00.260 --> 18:02.850
<i>We'll have to make up for Tsubasa's share too!</i>

18:03.850 --> 18:07.350
<i>Fine post-play by Nagano, the giant forward, with his skillful header!</i>

18:07.350 --> 18:08.350
Damn it!

18:08.350 --> 18:10.610
<i>However, Furano blocks it off!</i>

18:10.610 --> 18:11.230
Here!

18:11.230 --> 18:13.150
<i>Ishizaki quickly sends the ball up!</i>

18:13.150 --> 18:15.020
All right! You're doing great, Nankatsu!

18:15.020 --> 18:16.900
We're no slouch when it comes to teamwork!

18:17.440 --> 18:20.640
<i>There's no way they can win this just with Tsubasa's strength.</i>

18:20.640 --> 18:23.830
<i>So, in the end, this was Nankatsu's true strength all along.</i>

18:23.830 --> 18:24.790
Take this!

18:24.790 --> 18:26.930
<i>As expected, the ball goes to Tsubasa, at the goal!</i>

18:26.930 --> 18:29.420
<i>I can't allow you to get to this pass!</i>

18:29.420 --> 18:31.550
<i>Everyone created this chance for me.</i>

18:31.550 --> 18:33.920
<i>Even if I can't shoot, I'll create a pass!</i>

18:34.610 --> 18:37.340
<i>Tsubasa gets to the ball a second earlier than Matsuyama!</i>

18:37.340 --> 18:38.680
Counting on you, Izawa!

18:38.680 --> 18:42.350
<i>Even when Tsubasa's injured like he is,
he still shows us his best play!</i>

18:42.350 --> 18:44.760
<i>I will definitely score this one!</i>

18:44.760 --> 18:46.180
<i>I will reach!</i>

18:46.180 --> 18:49.210
<i>A desperate diving header from Izawa!</i>

18:52.360 --> 18:53.580
<i>It's in!</i>

18:53.580 --> 18:57.940
<i>Izawa demonstrates his jumping skills, and his Five Meter Diving Header pierces the net!</i>

18:57.940 --> 19:02.310
<i>Nankatsu finally turns the tables around by demonstrating teamwork that rivals Furano's own!</i>

19:02.310 --> 19:03.450
<i>2-1!</i>

19:03.450 --> 19:06.450
<i>This time, Furano will be chasing after Nankatsu!</i>

19:06.450 --> 19:08.220
You did it, Izawa!

19:08.220 --> 19:08.970
Did you see that?

19:08.970 --> 19:12.150
This is our team work!

19:12.150 --> 19:12.960
Wha—

19:13.970 --> 19:16.960
Tsubasa!

19:16.960 --> 19:17.960
What?!

19:17.960 --> 19:23.220
<i>When Tsubasa sent that pass to Izawa, he crashed into Matsuyama.</i>

19:23.220 --> 19:27.810
<i>It looks like they tripped over each other and fell, and he took a hit to his injured left leg.</i>

19:27.810 --> 19:28.890
Tsubasa...

19:28.890 --> 19:30.890
Are you all right, Tsubasa?

19:32.080 --> 19:33.600
I'm fine.

19:33.600 --> 19:34.750
More importantly...

19:35.600 --> 19:38.400
We got ahead of you now, Matsuyama!

19:39.080 --> 19:40.030
Tsubasa...

19:41.670 --> 19:46.910
<i>I was supposed to be completely marking him, but he used a mere few centimeters to send an assist.</i>

19:46.910 --> 19:49.690
<i>I had made up my mind before this match started...</i>

19:49.690 --> 19:52.420
<i>I would have no mercy on Tsubasa because he was injured.</i>

19:52.420 --> 19:58.000
<i>Tsubasa, as of this moment, I will definitely forget all about your injuries.</i>

19:59.510 --> 20:06.510
<i>I initially managed to stop the pain by thoroughly taping my foot, but it feels like it is flaring up again.</i>

20:06.510 --> 20:08.260
<i>The game resumes.</i>

20:08.260 --> 20:09.590
Let's do this, guys!

20:09.590 --> 20:11.970
We can't give up just after falling a goal behind!

20:11.970 --> 20:12.770
Yeah!

20:18.370 --> 20:19.410
<i>Damn it!</i>

20:19.410 --> 20:22.700
<i>Is this how an injured player supposed to play?!</i>

20:22.700 --> 20:25.980
<i>I don't have the strength to properly try to score anymore....</i>

20:25.980 --> 20:27.870
<i>What I can do is persistently mark him!</i>

20:30.500 --> 20:32.870
<i>Furano one-sidedly continue their attack!</i>

20:32.870 --> 20:35.480
<i>However, they can't even get a step closer to Nankatsu's goal!</i>

20:35.480 --> 20:37.290
Hold on, Furano!

20:37.290 --> 20:40.670
<i>Furano can keep their attack up even without Matsuyama...</i>

20:40.670 --> 20:42.800
<i>But, they just have no scoring ability.</i>

20:43.290 --> 20:45.910
<i>Right now, Matsuyama is completely being marked.</i>

20:45.910 --> 20:48.810
<i>Getting a goal off of Nankatsu will be incredibly hard for them.</i>

20:48.810 --> 20:51.020
<i>Nankatsu clears the ball again.</i>

20:51.020 --> 20:53.980
<i>Both captains fight for the loose ball.</i>

20:53.980 --> 20:56.370
<i>If I can arrive just a few seconds before he does,</i>

20:56.370 --> 20:58.770
<i>just a few centimeters of space will be enough!</i>

20:58.770 --> 21:00.530
<i>I won't let you shoot!</i>

21:00.530 --> 21:03.530
<i>Tsubasa blocks Matsuyama's shot!</i>

21:05.870 --> 21:09.150
<i>Did Tsubasa hurt his left leg again?!</i>

21:09.150 --> 21:10.410
Tsubasa...

21:11.390 --> 21:12.700
Tsubasa!

21:12.700 --> 21:14.200
Are you okay?

21:14.200 --> 21:16.110
We don't have much time left.

21:16.110 --> 21:18.000
Nankatsu is truly strong.

21:18.000 --> 21:19.710
Even though we keep attacking, we can't...

21:19.710 --> 21:23.850
Oda, you'll take the entrance exam for Furano HS, right?

21:23.850 --> 21:26.220
Wha— where did that suddenly come from?

21:26.220 --> 21:29.420
Yamamuro, you'll go to an agricultural high school.

21:29.420 --> 21:33.170
You like messing with machines, Wakamatsu. So you'll go to a technical high school.

21:33.170 --> 21:37.670
After middle school, you'll be helping your family at your farm, right, Kondo?

21:37.670 --> 21:38.730
Captain...

21:38.730 --> 21:41.820
I thought about this before this tournament started.

21:41.820 --> 21:46.650
We've all been playing football together since elementary school.

21:46.650 --> 21:50.740
But the summer of our third year...
This very tournament would be our last time.

21:50.740 --> 21:56.690
If we lost, that match would be the last match we'd all play together.

21:56.690 --> 21:58.030
Captain...

21:58.030 --> 22:03.760
So... So let's put everything we've gained so far into our play, and keep fighting!

22:03.760 --> 22:04.690
Guys!

22:04.690 --> 22:06.050
Captain!

22:09.220 --> 22:11.950
Are you all right, Tsubasa?

22:11.950 --> 22:14.230
Yes. I won't lose.

22:14.230 --> 22:15.220
There's no way I'll lose.

22:38.750 --> 22:44.800
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.750 --> 22:44.800
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.800 --> 22:50.800
<i>suguremono zo to machijû sawagu</i>

22:44.800 --> 22:50.800
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.800 --> 22:56.850
<i>chô-chô samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.800 --> 22:56.850
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.850 --> 23:01.480
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.850 --> 23:01.480
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.110 --> 23:07.780
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.110 --> 23:07.780
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.110 --> 23:15.200
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.110 --> 23:15.200
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:15.200 --> 23:21.250
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.250 --> 23:25.710
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.250 --> 23:25.710
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:27.000 --> 23:33.340
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:27.000 --> 23:33.340
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.340 --> 23:39.390
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.390 --> 23:45.690
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.390 --> 23:45.690
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

23:49.480 --> 23:58.990
COMING UP, EPISODE 45:
TEARS AT THE AIRPORT
